<section id="A9" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix I </span>Interventional Reasoning Prompts for Code Functions</h2>

<figure id="A9.T10" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A9.T10.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A9.T10.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
