<span id="A9.T10.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:341.4pt;">
<span id="A9.T10.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.T10.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">You are a language model that reasons about code without using any external execution environment.
Do not simply repeat the prompt. Instead, analyze the Python function below, provide step-by-step reasoning, and answer the <span id="A9.T10.2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">interventional</span> question.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
