<span id="A10.T11.2.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.T11.2.9.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Score execution based on whether the solution follows the code-simulation paths and performs step-by-step numerical computations faithfully and correctly. More simulation/computation mistakes <math id="A10.T11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> lower execution score.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
