The prompt template for LLM-as-a-judge analyses in §<a href="#S5" title="5 Behavioral Analysis of Reasoning Traces ‣ Executable Counterfactuals: Improving LLMs’ causal reasoning through code" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, with detailed evaluation rubrics for both <span id="A10.T11.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">planning</span> and <span id="A10.T11.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">execution</span> scores.
